  "body": "Come home to your spacious, modern family retreat, where tropical gardens, a heated pool and sun-filled living bring a holiday feel to every day. Tastefully renovated, this north-facing board and batten home enjoys a peaceful setting at the end of a private close, with central heating and cooling throughout for year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nThe beautifully updated kitchen features dual ovens, twin sinks and a generous island breakfast bar, flowing to inviting outdoor spaces. A Bali-inspired solid concrete saltwater pool offers heating options for year-round enjoyment, complemented by a spa and generous decks.\r\nThe flexible layout provides four double bedrooms plus a movie room or fifth bedroom, a study and three bathrooms, including two ensuites. Multiple living areas, including a separate rumpus with independent access, make it ideal for teenagers, extended family and guests. Upstairs, the large master retreat features a walk-in wardrobe and a balcony overlooking the pool, while generous additional storage throughout the home keeps family life organised.\r\n\r\nGaraging and a secure, gated property provide room for the boat and multiple vehicles. Zoned for Rangitoto College and other sought-after primary and intermediate schools, and with Rothesay Bay shops and beach within easy reach, this is North Shore family living at its best.\r\n\r\nContact Travis Adolph to discover this hidden gem.\r\n\r\nAuction 26th November at 12:00pm (Unless Sold Prior) \r\n\r\nTo view or download property files please go to: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/2ZEM",
